{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 59224, "game_id": 1069, "entry_id": 43848, "uid": 57068, "type": 4, "title": "七天任务天子推荐", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1603500443, "updated_at": 1603884372, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1603884372, "last_at": 0, "comment_count": 4, "status": 1, "summary": "七天丽莎任务天子推荐：前言：本文只列举出值得选的天子的用途，具体选择看个人图鉴和个人爱好，建议优先开图鉴，之后再高加，暗系天子由于本次是暗RAID，不建议选择，木系天子由于下次是木RAID也可以暂缓选", "thumb": "", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 11, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 26533, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 3, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 59224, "content": "<p>七天丽莎任务天子推荐：</p><p>前言：本文只列举出值得选的天子的用途，具体选择看个人图鉴和个人爱好，建议优先开图鉴，之后再高加，暗系天子由于本次是暗RAID，不建议选择，木系天子由于下次是木RAID也可以暂缓选择，由于本次RAID和下次RAID的属性，建议选择火系和光系的角色。</p><p>第一天：<img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500462944_39253186.png\" alt=\"T3OYT0YI0Q_06MS`THSXL{D\">木系百分比刀，适合RAID和WB。</p><p>        <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500462950_5011936.png\" alt=\"8OKWY9]J4]48VHI8V0HJHYN\">木系专属加速，适合WB使用，有上位替代木火奶。</p><p>        <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500462953_64539394.png\" alt=\"N~9704PG8%6$NM2LI8P5AFD\">老版暴击辅助，有上位代替鲁邦，适合WB使用。</p><p>        <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500462957_58776059.png\" alt=\"(H$4FN(G]1{00D{~5CLRS8K\">超好用的PVE盾，本期RAID就可用，效果很好。</p><p>        <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500462957_89054784.png\" alt=\"O$LE_1}8(2O0FI{CRF%J$MH\">适合WB和RAID的破防角色，SS出血萌新可以用来蹭地铁。</p><p>        <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500462958_13278988.png\" alt=\"4[@P@$KJ]JBPGZ0R4CIN`CN\">暗系百分比刀，适合WB。</p><p>         <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500462959_81856788.png\" alt=\"RV}9V{W`K_ICHG4%IPTE{NN\">持续奶很强势，点火后奶量爆炸，适合各种PVE场合。</p><p>        <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500462960_50976615.png\" alt=\"XE7BN]KBV0_YEVUY{$3GS@6\">PVP很强势的奶（点满火），建议PVP使用。</p><p>        <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500462961_86153335.png\" alt=\"%D3S}D[PE`{3KV5FIH[B60W\">万能加速辅助，适合全场合。</p><p>       <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500462961_41262712.png\" alt=\"`3Q{AI(V_)U9()R[SDBR7SY\"> 火双刃，RAID和WB必备辅助，除了魔龙之外都要用。，缺点是减防，练度不够可能暴毙。</p><p>        <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500462962_28228044.png\" alt=\"7$6DEWCT8Y_{ET)2DQ@)26I\">WB专用木系减抗角色，WB可选。</p><p>       <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500462963_37968340.png\" alt=\")~774LNX9}RWL_ZIRPNKN(3\">万能日常工具人，地铁皮肤塔必备，WB也可用。</p><p>        <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500462963_64772040.png\" alt=\"76}YDRPKN6ES%G~JL8XV$~I\">WB专用退DS控制，在某些需要控DS的WB中必备。</p><p>第二天：<img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500462964_64775411.png\" alt=\"PIKCATX`IC`}F4`0IIJ))[Q\">乱斗用角色，点火后提升很大。</p><p>        <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500462967_11004127.png\" alt=\"F@516MFTS51E4{DRWC(BHE1\">  暗双刃，RAID和WB必备辅助，缺点是减防，练度不够可能暴毙。</p><p>        <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500462968_33329128.png\" alt=\"HW$B9[($RO1PN~W5%RU6JRJ\">无敌盾，日常可能有用，立绘好看。</p><p>        <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500462969_76064795.png\" alt=\"SH@[`8GAOJN1K%1LY[N0K{W\">PVP和乱斗都好用加速辅助，动物控首选。</p><p>       <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500462970_62153900.png\" alt=\"[W(R`$M~LLE13MT3A2Q``[C\">适合作为助战的角色，本身技能PVP也不弱，没别的选择可选。</p><p>        <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500462971_62329682.png\" alt=\"Z2U8_W4I051%A1P2{42$OKK\">过度型弱点辅助，可以在全属性RAID和WB使用。</p><p>       <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500462972_79952106.png\" alt=\"@(%1`KCQGXAR)O@$I%E4FXJ\"> 加速加技能攻DS加攻击，很全面的辅助，适合大多PVE场合。</p><p>       <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500462973_17851954.png\" alt=\"XXNB0ZZVS~IY4MK%9X1D{}C\"> 光RAID专用狂暴刀，目前光RAID没有更好的选择。</p><p>      <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500462973_93191195.png\" alt=\"E5LGU2A89G}ON~__V0@}[O6\">光属性专用加速，在某些WB中可能有用，优先性不高。</p><p>       <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500462974_65177195.png\" alt=\"8Z83V((BPF4`PL~G[`6TE`T\">木WB专用最高弱点辅助，WB专用。</p><p>第三天：由于下次是木RAID，不建议选木券，其他随意。</p><p>第四天：<img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500462975_42023386.png\" alt=\"S4O_)W0{`5N~{I0G~D[ZXL4\">PVP和乱斗都超强的木刀，点火变六下刀，DS打全体。</p><p>        <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500462975_26418418.png\" alt=\")[1BI0(JIY}N_VGEIH7GS)C\">光WB专用弱点最高辅助，RAID也可用，提升巨大。</p><p>         <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500462976_39931932.png\" alt=\"VK(I@XLZYQ@~B1T1D55A$`2\">光双刃，RAID和WB必备辅助，缺点是减防，练度不够可能暴毙。</p><p>        <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500462977_85914003.png\" alt=\"}DLJ9M4%22EH@D{JH5~P6[G\">水系PVP最强势刀之一，点火六连，DS魔免。</p><p>       <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500462978_12235064.png\" alt=\"8QZDL}_@HOIX])]TM}MY3UR\"> 火RAID专用狂暴刀，但是跟玛斯不同，水刀有很多其他选择。</p><p>       <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500462979_51907089.png\" alt=\"A]1R5@3TAS%N4W~ME@BA0[U\">暗系超强PVP刀，点火六连，DS炸不死。</p><p>        <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500462980_17325695.png\" alt=\"N41Q[V1SN05S7M_%$ZT7HV1\">木双刃，RAID和WB必备辅助，缺点是减防，练度不够可能暴毙。</p><p>       <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500462982_77066867.png\" alt=\"]V30(C_3NB2KGB`($BINJ(9\">火仓鼠，万能火系加速，但是有上位替代火相机。</p><p>        <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500462983_44085605.png\" alt=\")05D3%]L{[%C[R}I8EO%J_L\">免疫奶，DS复活，RAID可能会用上。</p><p>      <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500462985_5067571.png\" alt=\"J_%YCI($`VZWF16XMJXW6WQ\">光百分比刀，暗WB必选，RAID也可用，立绘好看。</p><p>       <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500462986_34524573.png\" alt=\"CNC%5G9B0XU$7D$HSFJ}([A\">应援角色，WB过度辅助，死库水。</p><p>      <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500462987_56466731.png\" alt=\"Z$)6HZ1~B0WWUW)AID5H)CU\">DC最泛用辅助，适用于所有场合。</p><p>      <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500462988_71764200.png\" alt=\"A$(`(LMUAQ16)B(79SM1@}U\"> 火系PVP角色，重击混乱很好用。</p><p>      <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500462989_31432896.png\" alt=\"MUIZ60U[`IS(TKSGMU74UR4\">暗RAID专用狂暴刀，目前暗RAID没有更好的选择。</p><p>       <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500462990_95177281.png\" alt=\"Q32331P_Z{`~ABWBYBR@L7M\">万用弱点辅助，技能组比木莫娜更强一些，可过度全属性RAID和WB。</p><p>      <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500462991_63801646.png\" alt=\"@Y)P]A964WD6J17KX(}0B_T\">火系百分比刀，DS加攻，WB必备，RAID也可用。</p><p>       <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500462992_76970226.png\" alt=\"TV1`EXOL`TW)4`O$4D01F1S\">木RAID和WB必备辅助，N技能和S技能加成极高。</p><p>第五天：<img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500462993_59917366.png\" alt=\"E)T2H34X(W`5NN3OM_)~KJ5\">全属性WB专用额外加速角色，点满火可额外加速三体。</p><p>        <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500462994_56364426.png\" alt=\"B5Q8VJ1D[$C$AT(QZ5BN`XC\"> 光暗RAID竞速可选辅助，需要两只满P（一只点火一只不点火），择优先级一般。</p><p>        <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500462995_17301263.png\" alt=\"BQ3`3@{[ECJ}_X~25_1`C2X\">木RAID无敌缝合怪辅助，集各种BUFF为一体，必备。</p><p>        <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500462996_39559338.png\" alt=\"X]XY}[RXTFIS3A3M`IL81(9\">木系PVP体系的灵魂，PVP木队乱斗第一排必备角色，WB木系五人组必备刷条角色和DS人，万能辅助。</p><p>       <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500463000_91557188.png\" alt=\"G57MF5$}2D}IS{RI`%TWQW0\"> 超强PVP木刀，SS破不死，DS狂暴，乱斗必备木刀。</p><p>       <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500463005_10234553.png\" alt=\"MJW$5FKHLSIW8@P0A5IK0~E\">火系PVP控制，集输出控制为一体，PVP火队使用。</p><p>      <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500463006_73436764.png\" alt=\"(KN`RM%45F)3LB$CUWWQ4BQ\">WB首选首选首选控制，点火后使很多debuff全程，没有的一定优选。</p><p>      <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500463007_72708178.png\" alt=\"5TNA00Z)S~KJ]_``OHPME4J\"> 新水双刃，比丑人鱼更好，还有额外的回避率和异常回避，RAID和WB必备角色，皮肤都很好看。</p><p>      <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500463008_37805740.png\" alt=\"IMG_256\">水RAID目前最好木刀，甚至可以配合木系辅助强杀其他属性RAID。</p><p>     <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500463009_7008037.png\" alt=\"LXEFZ~211S2CHF%Z5C[(}HF\">PVP火队专用盾，拥有最高的重击嘲讽盾量，SS异常嘲讽，队长技能强，</p><p>缺点是挂机PVP智商差到无法使用，只能使用脚本手动PVP。</p><p>      <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500463010_87096627.png\" alt=\"WOK~)V_WCU08BNTHLE74Y`3\">PVP火队控制，输出不高，主要作为控制和破不死使用，由于PVP环境原因导致使用率下降，同样是挂机PVP智商极低，建议使用脚本或手动。</p><p>     <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500463011_84717322.png\" alt=\"XK%`}(@X~QH~23PJ}E`84T1\">PVE泛用性极强的水刀，重击集中SS百分比，WB必备，RAID也很好用。</p><p>      <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500463011_93817138.png\" alt=\"LO%NAMSY%0V~}IIU28C~0VJ\">具有额外时间扭曲加速的辅助角色，一般作为WB额外加速使用。</p><p>     <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500463012_18099165.png\" alt=\"%}RO02~T{J0}[%DC70)65Q9\">木RAID专用火刀，自带双刃节省一个位置，队长减CD，立绘好看。</p><p>     <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500463013_60816529.png\" alt=\"I8(646J1SV4}}BD6I4Q1E55\"> WB暗系专属加速，DS魅惑有奇效，皮肤塔地铁屁孩唯一指定辅助（重击远射buff），WB使用SS加速即可，皮肤塔设置N即可。</p><p>     <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500463014_62759793.png\" alt=\")1NWNPV$IBT7F]66[$1@1~A\"> 水系PVE超强辅助，自带水系专属加速和超高弱点伤害，DS重击伤害加成，水罗刹跨系斩车必备，重击刷条可以双刷竞速。</p><p>    <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500463014_1485672.png\" alt=\"2OK(V8VNB}C{M45_143R~ZG\">PVP超强暗系控制，点火后三DEBUFF加一次攻击可以直接把对面扒光。</p><p>    <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603500463016_70924962.png\" alt=\"C8B3HDR)D0$RTZ`8EW]D8)K\">火WB必备辅助，SS技攻应援让牡丹和初音直接下岗，DS的FT姿态可以</p><p>让FT伤害提升许多。</p><p>第六天第七天缺啥选啥。</p><p>总评分推荐选择：天子皮肤盒子，温泉皮盒子和点火盒子，闪卡盒子。</p><p>韩服DC ID：luvxsy</p><p>B站ID：DC玩家牛头鹿</p><p>交流群1143053990</p><p>个人游戏理解有限，分析仅供参考。</p><p>2020.10.23</p>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": null, "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 57068, "username": "DC玩家牛头鹿", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/18.png", "description": "", "follow_num": 34, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 1, "content_at": 131933115, "content_num": 10, "read_num": 107996, "like_num": 36}, "update_user": {"uid": 0, "username": "", "avatar": "", "description": "", "follow_num": 0, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 0, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "game": {"id": 1069, "name": "天命之子韩服", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603255687217_81752678.webp?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250", "alias": "destinychild", "content_count": 6962, "follow_count": 16729}, "themes": null, "seo_format": {"title": "", "desc": "", "key": ""}, "video_format": {"cover": "", "video": "", "width": "", "height": "", "duration": 0, "video_compressed": ""}, "contributor": null, "vote_list": null, "ban_image_list": null, "is_strategy": false, "is_strategy_v1": false, "entry_data_bind": null, "entry_data_bind_cdn": "", "emoji": [{"id": 6, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/332900.png", "count": 0, "is_like": false}, {"id": 4, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/652839.png", "count": 0, "is_like": false}, {"id": 3, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/36968.png", "count": 0, "is_like": false}, {"id": 12, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_6